<rml>
<head>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="theme.rcss"/>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="overmap_note.rcss"/>
</head>
<body>
    <!-- create_note preview backdrop (overmap_ui::create_note). A passive doc stacked
         UNDER the string_input "Note:" popup, replacing the curses w_preview / title /
         map panes. The #preview element is filled each keystroke by create_note's
         on_redraw via note_preview_rml() — the same producer the notes-manager callback
         uses, so the rendered preview is identical. Upper-left to match the curses
         layout (preview windows were anchored at the top-left). -->
    <div class="panel omn-panel">
        <div id="preview" class="cb-text"></div>
    </div>
</body>
</rml>
